The files in this directory are derived from test vectors published by the
National Institute of Standards and Technology (NIST) in the ACVP-Server
project, https://github.com/usnistgov/ACVP-Server, under
gen-val/json-files/SLH-DSA-{keyGen,sigGen,sigVer}-FIPS205/internalProjection.json.

NIST is acknowledged as the source, as its terms ask.

Changed from the originals: `tools/acvp-vectors.py` selects a subset of the
cases — those whose signature interface this implementation claims — and rewrites
the JSON as line-oriented text. No vector's values were altered; the hex strings
are the published ones. See that script for exactly what was selected and what
was left out, and re-run it to regenerate these files from the source.

